<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium ltx_font_italic">MetaWorld-<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFBFBF;">X</span></span>: Hierarchical World Modeling via VLM-Orchestrated Experts for Humanoid Loco-Manipulation
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
