<a href="#S2.SS2.p1.1" title="II-B Reinforcement Learning for Humanoid ‣ II Related Works ‣ MetaWorld-X: Hierarchical World Modeling via VLM-Orchestrated Experts for Humanoid Loco-Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§II-B</span></a>,
<a href="#S3.T1.12.1.5.1" title="In III-D VLM-Guided Semantic Routing for Expert Composition ‣ III Methodology ‣ MetaWorld-X: Hierarchical World Modeling via VLM-Orchestrated Experts for Humanoid Loco-Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">TABLE I</span></a>,
